sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant LangChain
    participant VectorStore
    participant LLM
    participant WebSearch
    
    User->>Frontend: Enter Question + Select Subject
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/query {query, subject}
    
    Backend->>LangChain: Process query
    
    LangChain->>VectorStore: Embed query
    VectorStore->>VectorStore: FAISS similarity search
    VectorStore-->>LangChain: Retrieved context chunks
    
    LangChain->>LLM: Send prompt with context
    LLM-->>LangChain: Structured JSON response
    
    LangChain->>WebSearch: Search for resources
    WebSearch-->>LangChain: Articles, images, videos
    
    LangChain->>LangChain: Combine LLM response + web results
    LangChain-->>Backend: Final structured response
    
    Backend-->>Frontend: JSON response {answer, topics, resources, etc.}
    Frontend->>User: Display formatted response